"900.5.10(200)":{"explanation":"Exception RT 200 sets site-specific setbacks (front 7.5 m on Middlefield Rd. or McNicoll Ave., 4.5 m at 55 to 95 Treetops Ct. odd numbers, otherwise 6.0 m; side 1.5 m; street side 7.5 m or 4.5 m), a 50 percent lot coverage cap, requires the parking space in the residential building, and also applies exception 900.5.10(352).","code_refs":"none"},
"900.5.10(204)":{"explanation":"Exception RT 204 keeps the lot frontage and lot area that existed on the day of the enactment of the By-law as the minimums, sets site-specific setbacks (front 7.5 m on Brimley Rd. or Midland Ave., otherwise 6.0 m; side 1.5 m; street side 7.5 m or 4.5 m), a 50 percent lot coverage cap, requires the parking space in the residential building, and also applies exception 900.5.10(352).","code_refs":"none"}}}
